<title>USA: Candela names F. Paul Broyer CFO.</title>
<headline>Candela names F. Paul Broyer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WAYLAND, Mass. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Candela Corp said Tuesday that it named F. Paul Broyer as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Broyer most recently served as vice president of finance for Integrated Genetics, a medical and genetic testing company.</p>
<p>Candela was not immediately available to comment on whom Broyer replaces, if anyone.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
